  "evidencia": "Page: Kristin Davis. Sentence: Kristin Landen Davis (also listed as Kristin Lee Davis; born February 23, 1965) is an American actress.\nPage: Kristin Davis. Sentence: She is known for playing Brooke Armstrong on the soap opera \"Melrose Place\" (1995–1996), and Charlotte York Goldenblatt on HBO's \"Sex and the City\" (1998–2004).\nPage: Sex and the City. Sentence: Sex and the City was an American romantic comedy television series created by Darren Star and produced by HBO.\nPage: Sex and the City. Sentence: Broadcast from 1998 until 2004, the original run of the show had a total of 94 episodes.\nPage: Miss Spider. Sentence: She originally appeared in cartoon format in the movie \"Miss Spider's Sunny Patch Kids\" (with Brooke Shields providing Miss Spider's voice), which spun off the \"Miss Spider's Sunny Patch Friends\" series (with Kristin Davis providing her voice this time around), and \"Miss Spider's Sunny Patch Friends - Harvest Time Hop and Fly\" video game.",
