        "original_id": "87abe5de-d500-5dff-8759-55b2a6c33bb5",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Kristin Davis, Darren Star, Brooke Shields\n- Products: Melrose Place, Sex and the City, Miss Spider's Sunny Patch Kids, Miss Spider's Sunny Patch Friends, Miss Spider's Sunny Patch Friends - Harvest Time Hop and Fly\n- Companies: HBO\n\nFacts:\n- Kristin Davis, also listed as Kristin Landen Davis and Kristin Lee Davis, was born on February 23, 1965 and is an American actress.\n- Sex and the City was an American romantic comedy television series created by Darren Star and produced by HBO.\n- Sex and the City originally aired from 1998 to 2004 and had 94 episodes in its original run.\n- Kristin Davis played Charlotte York Goldenblatt on HBO's Sex and the City from 1998 to 2004.\n- Kristin Davis played Brooke Armstrong on the soap opera Melrose Place from 1995 to 1996.\n- Miss Spider first appeared in the cartoon movie Miss Spider's Sunny Patch Kids, with Brooke Shields providing the voice of Miss Spider.\n- Miss Spider's Sunny Patch Kids spun off the series Miss Spider's Sunny Patch Friends, with Kristin Davis voicing Miss Spider, and the video game Miss Spider's Sunny Patch Friends - Harvest Time Hop and Fly.",
